# The image only needs `dags/` (Dockerfile: COPY dags/). Everything else in
# the repo is build/deploy tooling or tests -- keep it out of the build
# context so a stray local artifact can't end up baked into the image.
.git
tests/
chart/
sso/
vault/
postgres/
minio/
Makefile
README.md
kind-config.yaml
pytest.ini
*.tgz

# Never ship bytecode / caches -- the image compiles its own.
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
